845	/** Takes a statement of the person: records their due-total now (the sum of their counting claims'
846	 *  due figures, n/a ones skipped; n/a when their grade has no rate on the sheet's today and none of
847	 *  those claims keeps a settled or bound figure) on the sheet's today, and binds each counting claim
848	 *  to the figure it shows now; a claim that does not count is unbound. */
